@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@ideaId = PASTE_IDEA_ID
@postId = PASTE_POST_ID

### 1. Register a demo member (change the ID to register another member)
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/user/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"student-demo","pw":"DemoPassword123!","email":"student@example.com","name":"시연 학생","birth":"2000-01-01"}

### 2. Login and copy accessToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"student-demo","pw":"DemoPassword123!"}

### 3. Server status
GET {{baseUrl}}/common/health

### 4. Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/app/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Draw words
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/words/draw
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"aa88393f-142f-5803-a920-3ade6082bbb4"}

### 6. Generate an idea; repeat to verify cached=true
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/ideas
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"aa88393f-142f-5803-a920-3ade6082bbb4","wordIds":["1fd8d6ed-af7c-54d6-9679-04950118d26f","7e9865ba-d219-558a-b2e0-9fb258aa1d7b","dc7c6955-03b5-5bda-8a15-9e22834d4c05"],"direction":"간편한 캠핑 요리"}

### 7. Recipe (copy the idea ID from step 6)
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/ideas/{{ideaId}}/recipe
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Share link
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/shares
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ideaId":"{{ideaId}}"}

### 9. Publish to feed
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ideaId":"{{ideaId}}"}

### 10. Feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/app/posts?sort=latest&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. React using a DIFFERENT member token
PUT {{baseUrl}}/app/posts/{{postId}}/reaction
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"like"}
